Everything in harness/ is licensed under the MIT License below.

harness/lockstep and harness/grader are a fork of the harness from GBA Eval
(https://github.com/mechanize-work/gba-eval), adapted to the NES. The
original copyright notice is kept as the MIT License requires; changes
for NES Eval are described at the top of each modified file.

The grader loads the reference emulator (reference/nes-ref.wasm, built
from RustyNES, GPL-3.0-or-later) at runtime via wasmtime, in a separate
address space and across the published ABI (spec/ABI.md). It does not
link it, so the grader stays MIT while the reference module is GPL.

